Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.84,0:01:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}环形使者
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.72,0:01:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}时间旅行现在还不可行\N{\r}Time travel has not yet been invented.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.27,0:01:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}但三十年后 它将成为现实\N{\r}But 30 years from now, it will have been.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.33,0:02:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}堪萨斯州 2044年
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.73,0:01:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}但自它出现那一刻起便被列为非法\N{\r}It will be instantly outlawed,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.52,0:01:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}因而被世界上最大的犯罪组织秘密地收为己用\N{\r}used only in secret by the largest criminal organizations.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.79,0:02:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}在未来世界 要想销毁一具尸体几乎不可能\N{\r}It's nearly impossible to dispose of a body in the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.96,0:02:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}因为科技太发达\N{\r}I'm told. Tagging techniques, whatnot.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.59,0:02:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}当这些来自未来的犯罪组织想让某人销声匿迹时\N{\r}So when these criminal organizations in the future need someone gone,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.76,0:02:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}他们就雇佣被称为环形使者的特殊杀手来达成目的\N{\r}they use specialized assassins in our present called loopers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.56,0:02:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}因此\N{\r}And so,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.68,0:02:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}当我的那些来自未来的雇主抓住目标后\N{\r}my employers in the future nab the target.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.06,0:02:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}会把目标传送给我 他们的环形使者身边\N{\r}They zap him back to me, their looper.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.82,0:02:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}目标出现时 手被绑紧 头被蒙住\N{\r}He appears, hands tied and head sacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.03,0:02:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}而我把该做的做了\N{\r}And I do the necessaries.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.45,0:02:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}然后收钱即可\N{\r}Collect my silver.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.41,0:02:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}就这样 目标从未来消失了\N{\r}So the target is vanished from the future,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.24,0:02:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}而我只要将一个严格意义上来说根本不存在的尸体处理掉\N{\r}and I've just disposed of a body that technically does not exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.38,0:02:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}搞定\N{\r}Clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.63,0:03:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 你好 Joe - 你好 Beatrix\N{\r}- Bonjour Joe - Bonjour Beatrice
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.59,0:03:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 你的法语怎么样了 - 慢慢学呗\N{\r}- How's your French? - Slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.97,0:03:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 咖啡怎么样 - 焦了\N{\r}- How's the coffee? - Burnt.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.57,0:03:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}恶魔将你带到了地狱 而你必须得自我疗伤\N{\r}the devil bring you into hell! You have to heal yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.74,0:03:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}环形使者\N{\r}枪支存放处
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.97,0:03:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}换两块 Jed\N{\r}Two, Jed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.18,0:03:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}嘿 Joe\N{\r}Hey, Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.81,0:03:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 今晚去泡吧吗 - 去啊 \N{\r}- Be at the club tonight? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.89,0:03:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}换四块 Jed\N{\r}Four, Jed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.78,0:04:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}♪ Chuck And Mac - Powerful Love ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.35,0:04:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}小姐 你好\N{\r}Bonjour, mademoiselle
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.88,0:04:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&} 砰\N{\r} Bang.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.13,0:05:00.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}嘿 绕开走\N{\r}Hey, walk around.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.50,0:05:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}绕开这车走 我可没开玩笑 走远点 你这人渣\N{\r}Around the bike. I'm not kidding! Wide around, you shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.17,0:05:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你这人太粗鲁了 如果你有个妈 她一定没教育好你\N{\r}Rude! If you had a mama, she didn't raise you right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.14,0:05:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}那就好笑了 因为晚点我要用我这车载你老妈呢\N{\r}That's funny. I'm going to pick your mother up later on my bike,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.76,0:05:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 而且我要拿出我的枪 - 嘿 Seth\N{\r}- and I'm gonna take my blunderbuss... - Hey, Seth.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.98,0:05:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 嘿 Joe - 车看上去很潮啊 \N{\r}- Hey, Joe. - That's new.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.19,0:05:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}是嘛 谢谢夸奖\N{\r}Yeah, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.98,0:05:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}这天杀的车就是他妈的启动不了\N{\r}Goddamn thing won't fucking start.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.28,0:05:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你是要去Belle吗\N{\r}So you going to the Belle?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.78,0:05:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 你买了辆喷气机车 - 没错\N{\r}- So you bought a slab bike? - Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.49,0:05:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}那东西花了你多少钱 多少钱\N{\r}How much that thing set you back? How much?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.16,0:05:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我本来准备今晚骑着它炫一把呢\N{\r}I was gonna pull up in it tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.29,0:05:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}那恭喜你了 你要和最炫的人一起出现了\N{\r}Well, congratulations. You're pulling up with me instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.46,0:05:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}别这样 如果我们要进去 就甭玩那把戏\N{\r}Don't. If we're going in, don't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.58,0:05:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}小妞喜欢这我们这类人 她们可不\N{\r}Chicks dig TKs. They do not.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.50,0:05:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}才不是 她们喜欢 拉倒吧 这太俗了\N{\r}Yes, they do. It's tacky. Don't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.13,0:05:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}现今世界上有10%的人具有意念驱动能力 简称TK\N{\r}About 10 percent of the population has this TK mutation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.85,0:05:56.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}当这种能力第一次出现的时候 每个人都认为我们会成为超级英雄\N{\r}When it first appeared, everyone thought we were gonna get superheroes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.85,0:05:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}但是时间证明 TK也不过如此\N{\r}But it turns out this was it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.35,0:06:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}现在我们只是一群混蛋 觉得自己能够震撼人们的大脑\N{\r}Now it's a bunch of assholes, think they're blowing your mind floating quarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.83,0:06:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}似乎整个城市都是这样想的\N{\r}It's like this whole town.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.12,0:06:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}大人物 小人物\N{\r}Big heads, small potatoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.18,0:06:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 今晚满员了 Joe - 我们只在后台待一会儿 见见熟人 \N{\r}- Full house tonight, Joe. - We'll stick backstage. Just meeting up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.12,0:06:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}带上了你的枪了吗\N{\r}Packing your blunderbusses?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.85,0:06:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 没有 是吧 Seth - 我同Joe一起\N{\r}- Hardly. Right, Seth? - I'm with Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.02,0:06:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 见见熟人 马上就出来 - 进去吧\N{\r}- Just meeting up, in and out. - Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.86,0:06:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}Suzie\N{\r}Suzie!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.28,0:06:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 嘿 - 你今晚忙吗\N{\r}- Hey! - You working a shift tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.90,0:06:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 是啊 - 是吧\N{\r}- Yeah. - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.66,0:06:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}一个"枪手"今晚已经买断我了\N{\r}A gat man bought me out already for the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.28,0:06:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}噢 \N{\r}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.99,0:06:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}宝贝 我得去工作了\N{\r}Sweetie, I've got to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.17,0:07:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}嘿 Joe\N{\r}Hey, Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.55,0:07:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 怎么了 - Zack 他现在和Abe在里面\N{\r}- What? - Zach. He's in there right now with Abe.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.81,0:07:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 为什么 - 他被封环了\N{\r}- For what? - Closed his loop.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.31,0:07:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}不是吧\N{\r}No shit?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.23,0:07:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我们被叫环形使者也是有原因的\N{\r}There's a reason we're called Loopers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.69,0:07:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}当我们决定做这工作 处理来自未来的垃圾时\N{\r}When we sign up for this job, taking out the future's garbage,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.86,0:07:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我们也得遵守一个非常具体的规定\N{\r}we also agree to a very specific proviso.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.24,0:07:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}时间旅行在未来是非法的\N{\r}Time travel in the future is so illegal,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.37,0:07:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}因而当我们雇主想要停止我们的合同时\N{\r}that when our employers want to close our contracts,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.58,0:07:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}他们也会想要消除同我们有关的任何存在的犯罪痕迹\N{\r}they'll also want to erase any trace of their relationship with us ever existing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.51,0:07:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}所以如果我们还能再活三十年\N{\r}So if we're still alive 30 years from now,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.14,0:07:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}他们会找到老年的我们 把他送回到我们身边\N{\r}they'll find our older self, zap him back to us,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.10,0:08:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}而我们会像杀其他人一样 杀了自己\N{\r}and we'll kill him like any other job.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.60,0:08:07.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}这就叫做"封环"\N{\r}This is called closing your loop.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.61,0:08:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你那天报酬的会非常高 和你握一握手\N{\r}Eh, you get a golden payday, you get a handshake,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.61,0:08:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}从此你从你合同中解脱出来\N{\r}and you get released from your contract.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.99,0:08:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}然后好好享受你剩下的三十年吧\N{\r}Enjoy the next 30 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.24,0:08:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}这份工作不是为了吸引那些期待未来的人\N{\r}This job doesn't tend to attract the most forward- thinking people.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.79,0:08:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}那么我们庆祝一下\N{\r}So we celebrating?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.75,0:08:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}好啊 好\N{\r}Yeah! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.42,0:08:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}喔\N{\r}Whoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.37,0:09:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}小心\N{\r}Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.08,0:09:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}擦\N{\r}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.21,0:09:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}天啊\N{\r}Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.76,0:09:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}操你妹 Joe\N{\r}Fuck, Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.08,0:09:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你好 Joe\N{\r}Bonjour Joe
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.61,0:09:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}很高兴见到你\N{\r}Rave de te voir, Beatrix
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.20,0:09:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}不错嘛\N{\r}Ooh, la, la.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.34,0:09:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}那是怎么回事 这个月第四个封环的\N{\r}What, fourth loop closed this month?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.46,0:09:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}为封环干杯\N{\r}Loop closed. Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.15,0:10:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}封环了 亲\N{\r}Loop closed, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.14,0:10:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}来了\N{\r}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.45,0:11:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}Seth \N{\r}Seth?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.20,0:11:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}老天\N{\r}Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.62,0:11:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}嘘 他们随时可能来\N{\r}Shh. They could be here any minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.41,0:11:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 有人在这儿吗 - 没在 谁啊\N{\r}- Are they here? - No. Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.16,0:11:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}噢 天啊 Joe 天啊\N{\r}Oh, Christ. Joe, Christ!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.84,0:11:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 你在干什么 - 把枪给我\N{\r}- What are you doing? - Give me the gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.96,0:11:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}噢 好吧 算你聪明 \N{\r}Oh, right. That's smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.71,0:11:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 离窗户远一点 - 天啊 Joe\N{\r}- Get away from the window. - Christ, Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.76,0:11:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 给我冷静点 - 你会保护我吧\N{\r}- Just quiet down. - You can protect me.right
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.24,0:11:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你到底做了些什么\N{\r} What did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.10,0:11:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}噢 天啊 这就是个噩梦\N{\r}Oh, jeez. This is like a nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.06,0:11:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}这就是个噩梦\N{\r}This is a nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.81,0:11:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我知道他做了些什么 因此我也不知道我为什么还要问\N{\r}I knew then what he did, so I don't know why I asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.35,0:11:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你做些了什么\N{\r}What did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.61,0:11:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}他 他在唱歌\N{\r}He... He was singing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.57,0:11:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}尽管蒙着头袋 但是我能听清楚曲调\N{\r}Through the gag and sack, but I could hear the tune.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.20,0:11:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}印象很深\N{\r}Deep memories,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.45,0:11:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}那是我妈妈在黑暗的房间里照顾我时哼的曲调\N{\r}my mom in a dark room, taking care of me, singing that tune.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.42,0:12:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}一旦知道他就是我\N{\r}Once I knew he was me...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.80,0:12:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我\N{\r}I...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.60,0:12:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}Joe 我下不了手\N{\r}Joe, I couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.35,0:12:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我下不了手 我得看看他\N{\r}I couldn't. I had to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.85,0:12:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}他告诉我 我还记得 他告诉我\N{\r}He told me... I remember, he told me,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.65,0:12:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}未来世界里有一个十分吓人的新老板\N{\r}there's a new holy terror boss man in the future,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.70,0:12:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}他要封死所有人的环\N{\r}and he's closing all the loops.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.45,0:12:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}他们都叫他 唤雨师\N{\r}The Rainmaker, they call him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.74,0:12:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}他告诉我 然后他说想抽一支烟\N{\r}He told me it. Then he wanted a cigarette.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.17,0:12:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}所以我给他松绑 他给了我这个表情\N{\r}So I untied him, and he gives me this look.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.21,0:12:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}然后他开始逃跑\N{\r}And he just starts running.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.38,0:12:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我当时手里握着枪\N{\r}I had my blunderbuss,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.97,0:12:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我知道知道他只要再跑15步就会逃出我的射程范围\N{\r}so I know I've got about 15 strides till he's out of my range.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.60,0:12:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我放任机会流走\N{\r}And they come and they go,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.06,0:12:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我就这样看着他逃跑\N{\r}and I just watch him till he's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.73,0:12:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}这叫做封环失败\N{\r}This is called letting your loop run.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.48,0:13:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}这不是什么好事\N{\r}It's not a good thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.48,0:13:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我该怎么办\N{\r}What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.65,0:13:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你是我唯一的朋友 Joe 你得帮帮我\N{\r}You're the only friend I've got, Joe. You've got to help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.58,0:13:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}笨蛋才他妈的会来这儿\N{\r}You're a fucking idiot coming here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.79,0:13:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你不能呆在这儿 我给你点儿钱 \N{\r}You can't be here. I'll give you some money.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.33,0:13:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}Joe 一点钱 我能去哪儿啊\N{\r}Joe! A little money? Where am I gonna go?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.54,0:13:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}跳上一辆货车 你可以火速地逃出去\N{\r}You hop a freight train. You beat it the hell out of town.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.30,0:13:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}闭嘴\N{\r}Shh!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.72,0:13:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}别动\N{\r}Just don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.22,0:13:34.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}叫Cor去看着窗户外面\N{\r}Tell Court, watch the window outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.93,0:13:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}明白 窗户\N{\r}You got it, window.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.65,0:13:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- Joe 快开门 - 马上来\N{\r}- Kid Blue, Joe! Come on! - Just a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.32,0:13:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}快点给老子开门 我什么都不能为你做 Seth\N{\r}Open this goddamn door! I can't do anything for you, Seth.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.94,0:13:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你得把我藏起来 求你了 Joe 把我藏起来\N{\r}You've got to hide me! Please, Joe! Hide me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.91,0:13:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}拜托 给我争取点时间 然后我就走\N{\r}Please! Just buy me some time and then I'll go! Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.16,0:13:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你是逼我把这门炸开吗\N{\r}You gonna make me blow this door down?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.37,0:13:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}来了 马上来\N{\r}Yeah, hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.33,0:13:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}求你了\N{\r}Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.96,0:14:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}让开 让开\N{\r}Move. Move.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.96,0:14:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}快点 Joe 开门\N{\r}Come on, Joe! Open up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.68,0:14:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}天啊\N{\r}Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.53,0:14:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}布置这房子花了你不少时间吧 你觉得扮的漂亮很容易吗\N{\r}That took a while. You think it's easy looking this good?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.15,0:14:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我们出去和Abe谈谈的时候\N{\r}Tye's gonna watch your
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.48,0:14:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}Tye负责"照管"你的公寓\N{\r}apartment while we go have a talk with Abe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.99,0:14:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}那罐头里有咖啡\N{\r}There's coffee in the tin.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.91,0:14:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}谢了\N{\r}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.85,0:14:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}给我两分钟时间\N{\r}Give me two minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.07,0:15:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}知道为什么他们把你的大口径短枪叫做豌豆射手\N{\r}Know why they call that pea shooter of yours a blunderbuss?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.12,0:15:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}因为十五码外 它基本上不可能击中任何目标\N{\r}Because it's impossible to hit anything farther than 15 yards.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.83,0:15:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}但也不可能射偏十五码以内的东西\N{\r}Impossible to miss anything closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.67,0:15:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}这是一把专为蠢货准备的枪\N{\r}It's a gun for fuck- up turkeys.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.29,0:15:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}不像手枪\N{\r}Not like a gat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.71,0:15:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}手枪射程更远\N{\r}A gat has range.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.93,0:15:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}更精准\N{\r}Accuracy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.93,0:15:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}Kid 别玩了 不然你会把你另一只脚也打烂的\N{\r}Kid, cut it out. Don't blow your other foot off.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.83,0:16:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我操 这外面发生了什么\N{\r}Fuck! What the hell is going on out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.46,0:16:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 近来可好 Abe - 嘿 Joe\N{\r}- How you doin', Abe? - Hey. Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.96,0:16:11.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你没把你另外一只脚打烂 是吧 Kid\N{\r}You didn't shoot your other foot off, did you, Kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.18,0:16:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}是啊\N{\r}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.81,0:16:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我的曾祖父告诉我的祖父 人类就如同蜘蛛一样\N{\r}My great- grandfather told my grandfather, "Men are like spiders.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.06,0:16:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你必须小心这些小东西\N{\r}It's the little ones you've got to be careful of.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.90,0:16:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我不太清楚我是否同意这言论\N{\r}Don't know I agree with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.36,0:16:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}是吗 哈\N{\r}Yeah? Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.90,0:16:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我曾祖父知道他妈的些什么\N{\r}What the fuck did my great- grandfather know?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.61,0:16:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}这个人来自未来\N{\r}This man is from the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.91,0:16:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}他手持单程票被黑帮送回到现在管理环形使者\N{\r}He was sent back here by the mob, a one- way ticket, to run the loopers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.20,0:16:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}这工作对他而言轻而易举 所以为了打发时间\N{\r}That's low effort, even for Abe, so to pass the time,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.21,0:16:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}他招了些壮汉 也就是"枪手"\N{\r}he recruited some real muscle, the gat men.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.79,0:16:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}现在他不仅掌管着这座城市 是所有城市 令人钦佩\N{\r}Now he runs the city,any other city, that would be impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.27,0:17:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你们这些孩子怎么忍受戴这些鬼东西的\N{\r}How can you kids stand to wear those chokers?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.81,0:17:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 领结 - 是领带\N{\r}- Cravats? - Ties.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.19,0:17:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}可笑 我们可没有一条穿衣法规 你又不是不知道\N{\r}Ridiculous. You're aware we don't have a dress code?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.32,0:17:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 时尚嘛 - 你知道 好吧 你不知道\N{\r}- Fashion. - You know... Well, you don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.03,0:17:19.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你模仿电影里的打扮 可那部电影却是个山寨货\N{\r}The movies that you're dressing like are just copying other movies.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.03,0:17:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}这就是他妈的二十世纪的装腔作势\N{\r}These goddamn 20th century affectations.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.87,0:17:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}尝试些新事物嘛 \N{\r}Do something new. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.71,0:17:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}脖子上 套一个发光物体 或者用一点橡胶制品\N{\r}Put a glowing thing around your neck or use rubberized...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.46,0:17:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 稍微换个样子 - 好吧\N{\r}- Just be new. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.55,0:17:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 和你谈话真的很愉快 Abe - 我很欣赏你 Joe\N{\r}- It was nice chatting with you, Abe. - I do like you, Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.60,0:17:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}但我很确定Seth去了你那里一趟\N{\r}But we're sure enough that Seth paid you a visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.56,0:17:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 对此我们必须要采取些行动 - Seth\N{\r}- We have to do something. - Seth?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.52,0:17:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你是不是觉得我们会用锤子把你的手指敲断\N{\r}You're expecting we're gonna break your fingers with a hammer,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.11,0:17:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}或者是其他的酷刑来逼供\N{\r}or something awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.73,0:17:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}但是 我现在要消除你这种紧张感\N{\r}But I'm gonna defuse that tension right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.11,0:17:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}那种事不会发生的 \N{\r}That's not gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.57,0:18:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}会发生的是我要稍微谈一下\N{\r}What is gonna happen is that I'm gonna talk for a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.53,0:18:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}甚至不会太久\N{\r}Not even that long.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.95,0:18:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}然后你就会交出你的朋友了\N{\r}And you're gonna give up your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.04,0:18:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我的朋友 Seth 抱歉 我 我有点不懂了\N{\r}My friend? Seth? Sorry, I'm confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.33,0:18:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}那好吧 我稍微谈一谈\N{\r}Well, then I'll talk a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.34,0:18:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你知道吧 你是我雇佣过的最年轻的环形使者\N{\r}You know, you were the youngest looper I ever hired.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.84,0:18:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你看上去他妈的太可笑了 他们都这样说\N{\r}You looked goddamn ridiculous, they said.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.64,0:18:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你拿着枪的样子\N{\r}Blunderbuss up to here on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.01,0:18:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 他们把你带进来 我忘了是因为什么 - 手表店\N{\r}- They brought you in. I forget what for. - Watch shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.89,0:18:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}对 你偷了我们一家店 那家手表店\N{\r}Yeah. You rolled one of our fronts, a watch shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.52,0:18:34.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}他们抓住了你 你应该还记得 这孩子 就像头野兽一样\N{\r}And they had you, you know. This kid, like an animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.73,0:18:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}但是你看着我 你的头发遮住了你半张脸\N{\r}But you looked at me, your hair stuck to half your face,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.70,0:18:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}只有一只眼睛看着我 我能看见\N{\r}just one eye looking at me. I could see,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.58,0:18:47.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}就像通过电视看见一切发生的事 你糟糕的人生境遇\N{\r}like seeing it happen on the TV, the bad version of your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.20,0:18:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}如同一张图画 我能看见你是怎么沦落至此的\N{\r}Like a vision, I could see how you'd turn bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.88,0:18:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}所以我改变了\N{\r}So I changed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.50,0:18:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我把你清洗干净 然后在你手中放下一把枪\N{\r}I cleaned you up and put a gun in your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.64,0:19:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 我给了原本属于你的东西 - 对此我十分感激 Abe\N{\r}- I gave you something that was yours. - I'm grateful for that, Abe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.26,0:19:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我给了原本属于你的东西\N{\r}I gave you something that was yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.06,0:19:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我还依然记得那些 孩子\N{\r}And I remember that kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.86,0:19:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我认为如果你扪心自问\N{\r}And I think if you ask yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.75,0:19:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}"我会为了谁 牺牲原本属于我的东西"\N{\r}you ask, who would I sacrifice for what's mine?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.82,0:19:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我认为Seth就是你的最佳答案\N{\r}I think Seth would be deep and cozy inside that circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.12,0:19:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}现在我就来展示一下我对你的了解\N{\r}I'll show you how much I know you. Ahem.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.29,0:19:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我甚至不用毁了你 只需要把你打回原形即可\N{\r}I'm not even gonna break you. I'm just gonna set you back a ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.58,0:19:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我知道你把你一半的酬金都攒了起来\N{\r}We know that you've been stashing half your bars.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.71,0:19:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}此举十分聪明 没有法规不允许 你会离开这儿 \N{\r}Which is smart, no law against it. You're gonna get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.88,0:19:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}从此远走高飞 开始学习你的普通话\N{\r}You're gonna go overseas. Studying up your Mandarin?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.84,0:19:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 法语 - 法语\N{\r}- French? - French.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.06,0:19:51.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你把他交出来 不然你交出你半数的积蓄\N{\r}You give him up or you give us half your stash.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.77,0:19:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你愿意为了Seth 放弃你的银子吗\N{\r}You willing to dump your silver in the dirt for Seth?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.41,0:20:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你要把他杀了\N{\r}You're gonna kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.49,0:20:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}别无他法的话\N{\r}Not if we can help it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.02,0:20:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}对未来来说这是毁灭性的改变\N{\r}Be too cataclysmic a change for the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.17,0:20:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}从那层面讲 我们要做的事很危险\N{\r}What we'll do is dangerous in that regards,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.09,0:20:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}但是总比直接把他杀了好一点\N{\r}though not as dangerous as killing him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.42,0:20:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}目前最危险的就是那个来自未来的人自由太久了\N{\r}On top of which a man from the future runs free long enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.84,0:20:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}时间旅行的事会把你的脑子像鸡蛋一样给炸了\N{\r}this time travel shit fries your brain like an egg.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.10,0:20:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}为什么要学法语\N{\r}Why the fuck French?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.39,0:20:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我要去法国\N{\r}I'm going to France.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.14,0:20:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 你应该去中国 - 我要去法国\N{\r}- You should go to China. - I'm going to France.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.89,0:20:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我从未来来 你应该去中国\N{\r}I'm from the future. You should go to China.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.48,0:20:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 我要去法国 - 你应该去...\N{\r}- I'm going to France. - You're going...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.58,0:20:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}地板的小毯子下面有个保险箱\N{\r}The floor safe, under the rug.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.04,0:20:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}密码六 七 四 二\N{\r}Six seven four two.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.55,0:21:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}小个的给力\N{\r}It's the little ones that get you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.35,0:21:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}Joe 为什么不再待一会儿 本店请客\N{\r}Why don't you kill an hour, Joe. On the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.86,0:21:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}叫医生\N{\r}Call the doc.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.16,0:21:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}15分钟内赶到Wire街75号
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.66,0:22:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}等等\N{\r}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.08,0:23:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}等等\N{\r}Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.38,0:23:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}等等\N{\r}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.11,0:24:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我记不起我妈妈长什么样子了\N{\r}You know, I can't remember my mother's face.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.20,0:24:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}她总是用手拨弄我的头发\N{\r}She used to run her hands through my hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.71,0:24:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}就像这样\N{\r}Just like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.56,0:24:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}今晚我害死了我最好的朋友\N{\r}I think I just let my best friend get killed tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.65,0:24:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}为了钱\N{\r}For silver.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.57,0:24:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}真糟\N{\r}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.03,0:24:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}是啊\N{\r}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.28,0:25:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}真糟\N{\r}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.46,0:25:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}很遗憾\N{\r}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.50,0:25:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我会给你点钱\N{\r}I'm gonna give you some money.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.59,0:25:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}这些钱我藏了好久了\N{\r}I've been stashing my silver
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.08,0:25:14.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我会分给你一半\N{\r}for years and I'm gonna give you half of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.34,0:25:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你可以好好养你的孩子了\N{\r}You can raise your kid right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.64,0:25:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你要把一半的钱给我\N{\r}You wanna give me half your silver?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.72,0:25:23.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}钱很用 但我自己有工作\N{\r}Silver's got strings. I got my job.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.48,0:25:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你有你的\N{\r}You got yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.23,0:25:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你为我担心真好 但是我做得很好\N{\r}It's sweet of you to worry about me, but I'm doing fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.65,0:25:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我们为什么不继续这种服务关系\N{\r}Why don't we just stick to services rendered.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.40,0:25:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}这是不是就是你想的妈妈式抚摸\N{\r}Is this what you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.08,0:27:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}擦\N{\r}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.35,0:29:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}然后开始变得一团糟 就像是一场如猪般操蛋的足球\N{\r}Then it just becomes a mess, like a pig fucking a football.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.68,0:29:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你知道我在说什么 我们把这杯喝完吧\N{\r}You know what I'm saying. Let's finish this up.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.40,0:29:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 这是24块 - 我在数呢\N{\r}- There's 24 there. - I'm keeping count.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.78,0:29:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}还要两趟就行了\N{\r}Two more trips should just do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.47,0:30:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}见鬼 啊\N{\r}Goddamn it! Aah!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.64,0:30:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}Kid 我很抱歉 告诉Abe我一定会补救\N{\r}Kid, I'm sorry! Tell Abe I'm gonna fix this!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.56,0:30:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}告诉他我会找到我的使者 我会杀了他 告诉Abe\N{\r}Tell him I'm gonna find my loop and I'm gonna kill him! Tell Abe...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.61,0:30:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}操你妈的\N{\r}Motherfucker!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.26,0:31:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}第一年
