Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.43,0:33:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}第25年
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.69,0:34:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}第30年
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.43,0:36:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}擦\N{\r}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.46,0:36:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 你还有阿司匹林吗 - 有\N{\r}- You got any aspirin? - Uh- huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.59,0:37:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}把它们全拿来\N{\r}All of them, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.38,0:37:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}这件外套我也要了\N{\r}I'll take that coat too.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.11,0:37:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你在干嘛\N{\r}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.54,0:37:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}Joe 你在干嘛 我告诉你快跑\N{\r}What are you doing? Joe, I told you to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.35,0:37:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}不要这么做 白痴\N{\r}Don't do it, you idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.86,0:38:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}快点 蓝小孩\N{\r}Hurry up, Blue!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.15,0:38:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}这是第二个使者\N{\r}That's the second loop
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.60,0:38:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}这周我们都得跑了 真是奇特啊\N{\r}we had run this week. It's getting endemic.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.33,0:38:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}该死的Kid Blue\N{\r}Fucking Kid Blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.04,0:38:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}大概还有两躺就行了\N{\r}About two more trips should do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.29,0:38:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}操\N{\r}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.23,0:39:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你这个小蠢货\N{\r}You stupid little shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.49,0:39:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}走人行道 搜索火车站\N{\r}Pound the pavement, sweep the train yard.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.78,0:39:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}每过一秒情况就更糟 快去\N{\r}Every second that passes is bad. Get on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.74,0:39:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}小蠢货\N{\r}Stupid little shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.37,0:39:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我可以搞定这些\N{\r}I can fix this.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.71,0:39:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 会找到他的 - 回去\N{\r}- I can find him! - Go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.92,0:39:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}让大人来做吧\N{\r}Let the grownups work.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.01,0:39:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}Kid Blue\N{\r}Kid Blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.42,0:40:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你个混蛋 我要怎么样才能找到你\N{\r}You bastard. How do I find you?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.55,0:42:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}咖啡\N{\r}Coffee?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.85,0:42:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}麻烦了\N{\r}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.02,0:42:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}黑咖啡 再给我点水\N{\r}Black. And some water.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.60,0:42:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}还要什么吗\N{\r}Anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.02,0:42:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我们要吃吗\N{\r}We eating?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.36,0:42:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我点过了\N{\r}I ordered something.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.86,0:42:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}牛排和煎蛋 很嫩 很好吃\N{\r}Steak and eggs. Rare and scrambled.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.19,0:42:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}两份牛排加鸡蛋 马上来\N{\r}Two steak and eggs, coming up.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.49,0:43:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}很疼吧\N{\r}Must hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.66,0:43:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我不确定你是不是还记得她 我把它们串在了一起\N{\r}I wasn't sure you'd remember her. I put it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.12,0:43:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}聪明吧\N{\r}Clever.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.59,0:43:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}曾经有个姑娘在这工作了几周\N{\r}You know, there's another girl who works here on the weekends.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.97,0:43:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- Jen - 是我 少些字母\N{\r}- Jen? - Right. Less letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.35,0:43:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}那应该好些\N{\r}That'd be better.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.15,0:43:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你的法语学的怎么样了\N{\r}How's your French coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.15,0:43:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}还行 你要告诉我怎么学普通话吗\N{\r}Good. You gonna tell me I ought to be learning Mandarin?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.82,0:43:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我从来没有后悔学过法语\N{\r}I never regretted learning French.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.91,0:43:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我知道你两腿间夹着把枪\N{\r}I know you have a gun between your legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.66,0:43:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}没有 好吧 你会懂的\N{\r}No? Well, you'll get it eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.29,0:43:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 这很明显 - 好吧 听着\N{\r}- Obviously. - All right, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.38,0:43:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}现在情况不容乐观\N{\r}This is a hard situation,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.77,0:43:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}但是我们都知道接下来会发生什么\N{\r}but we both know how this has to go down.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.22,0:44:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我不能让你活着离开\N{\r}I can't let you walk away from this diner.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.72,0:44:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}现在是我的生活 我赚来的 你也有了你的\N{\r}This is my life now. I earned it. You had yours already.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.80,0:44:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}为什么不像别的人一样去死呢\N{\r}So why don't you do what old men do and die?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.75,0:44:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}别他妈的来挡我的路\N{\r}Get the fuck out of my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.73,0:44:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}为什么你不拿出你夹在两腿之间的枪打死我呢\N{\r}Why don't you take your gun out from between your legs and do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.07,0:44:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}小子\N{\r}Boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.99,0:44:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}直视你的眼睛很难\N{\r}It's hard staring into your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.54,0:44:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 感觉太奇怪了 - 就像面对着过去的自己\N{\r}- It's too strange. - Your face looks backwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.92,0:44:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}所以你知道接下来会发生什么吗 你已经经历过了\N{\r}So you know what's gonna happen? You've done all this already?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.34,0:44:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我不想谈论狗屁的时间旅行\N{\r}I don't want to talk about time travel shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.05,0:44:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}因为如果我们开始讨论它 我们就会在这呆一整天\N{\r}If we start talking about it, we're gonna be here all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.26,0:44:43.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}一边讨论一边给你画图示意\N{\r}Making diagrams with straws.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.09,0:44:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 这不重要 - 如果我伤了我自己就会改变你的身体\N{\r}- It doesn't matter. - I hurt myself, it changes your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.26,0:44:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 我现在所做的事也就会改变你的记忆 - 这并不重要\N{\r}- Does what I do change your memories? - It doesn't matter!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.90,0:45:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我的记忆很模糊\N{\r}My memory is cloudy.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.99,0:45:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}非常模糊\N{\r}It's a cloud.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.49,0:45:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}因为我的记忆都不是真的\N{\r}Because my memories aren't really memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.08,0:45:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}它们现在只是不确定的可能性之一\N{\r}They're just one possible eventuality now.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.71,0:45:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}它们会变得越来越清晰\N{\r}And they grow clearer or
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.62,0:45:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}或者变得越来越模糊\N{\r}cloudier as they become more or less likely.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.30,0:45:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}但是当它们到达现在这个时刻\N{\r}But then they get to the present moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.65,0:45:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}它们会立刻变得清晰起来\N{\r}and they're instantly clear again.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.47,0:45:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我会清晰的记忆你做过的每一件事\N{\r}I can remember what you do after you do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.64,0:45:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}真的很痛\N{\r}And it hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.19,0:45:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}所以即使现在我们分开\N{\r}So even when we're apart,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.48,0:45:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 我做了什么你依然都知道 - 是的\N{\r}you can remember what I do after? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.86,0:45:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}但是这是对模糊机制的正确描述\N{\r}But this is a precise description of a fuzzy mechanism.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.24,0:45:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}它很混乱\N{\r}It's messy.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.11,0:45:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我所知道的 只有两件事\N{\r}All I know... I know two things.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.12,0:45:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我知道在我的脑子里发生了什么\N{\r}I know what's happening in my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.18,0:45:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我知道你还是会见到她的\N{\r}And I know that you're gonna meet her.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.29,0:45:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}谁\N{\r}Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.97,0:46:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}一个会拯救你生命的女人\N{\r}She's gonna save your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.97,0:46:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}很长一段时间她都在想\N{\r}For a long time, she thought we'd...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.64,0:46:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我们会有个孩子\N{\r}We'd have a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.77,0:46:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}她会是个好妈妈\N{\r}She'd have been a great mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.20,0:46:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 她很想要孩子 - 好吧 但是她\N{\r}She wanted it so much. Yeah, but she...?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.16,0:46:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}怎么\N{\r}How...?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.16,0:46:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}所以她救了我的命\N{\r}So she saves my life?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.08,0:46:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}对\N{\r}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.50,0:46:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}让我们回顾下你的生活\N{\r}Let's take a look at your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.75,0:46:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你是个杀手 还是个瘾君子\N{\r}You're a killer. And a junkie.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.59,0:46:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}还他妈心智不成熟\N{\r}A fucking child mentality.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.88,0:46:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}"什么是我的" "我的生活"拯救了你的生活 你问我怎样救的\N{\r}"What's mine." "My life." Save your life. You're asking me how?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.72,0:46:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}问题是为什么 为什么有人要牺牲自己的生命\N{\r}The question is why. Why would someone sacrifice their life?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.05,0:46:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}别放屁了 我不需要有人来拯救我的生活\N{\r}Cut your high and mighty bullshit. I don't need my life...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.85,0:46:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}闭上你幼稚的臭嘴\N{\r}Shut your fucking child mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.73,0:47:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你自以为是又愚蠢\N{\r}You're so self- absorbed and stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.73,0:47:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}她会净化你 她会\N{\r}And she's gonna clean you up and she's gonna...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.66,0:47:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你只会像海绵一样吸干她的爱\N{\r}You're gonna take her love like a sponge.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.33,0:47:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}然后你会想 也许 我已经和过去彻底划清界限了\N{\r}And you think, maybe I'm clear of the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.75,0:47:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}也许我安全了\N{\r}Maybe I'm safe."
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.13,0:47:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}昨天\N{\r}Yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.80,0:47:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}昨天什么\N{\r}Yesterday what?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.26,0:47:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}30年后的昨天\N{\r}Thirty years from now is yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.39,0:47:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你不会记得\N{\r}You're not gonna remember it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.32,0:47:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我要告诉你那个拯救了你这个垃圾的美丽女人发生了什么\N{\r}I'm gonna tell you what happens to this beautiful woman who saves your worthless fucking life.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.20,0:48:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你听说了唤雨师吗\N{\r}Have you heard of the Rainmaker?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.58,0:48:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}知道 Seth那天晚上说过了\N{\r}Yeah, Seth said that night.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.25,0:48:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}来自未来的新老板 他用那些恐怖的手段\N{\r}New boss in the future? He used the words "Holy terror."
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.55,0:48:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}是啊 恐怖统治\N{\r}Yeah. A reign of terror.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.42,0:48:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}大规模处决 清除流浪者 就地处决\N{\r}Mass executions. Vagrant purges. Everywhere at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.47,0:48:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}传奇的是没有人知道这个唤雨师的来历\N{\r}Legend is the Rainmaker came out of nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.35,0:48:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}在六个月内\N{\r}In the span of six months,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.70,0:49:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}他就全盘掌握了五家大财团\N{\r}he took total control of the five major syndicates.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.52,0:49:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 那需要军队吧 - 但是他一个兵也没有\N{\r}- That'd take an army. - He didn't have an army.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.06,0:49:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}传说他一个人搞定的\N{\r}The story is that he did it alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.06,0:49:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 单枪匹马 - 他怎么做到的\N{\r}- Alone alone. - So how did he do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.36,0:49:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}这就是秘密了 没人见过他的照片\N{\r}That's the mystery. There's no pictures of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.93,0:49:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}是男是女都不知道 真不可思议\N{\r}Even if it is a him. It's insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.90,0:49:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}传说他的下巴是人造的\N{\r}There are stories he has a synthetic jaw,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.37,0:49:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}亲眼见到他妈妈被杀之类的\N{\r}saw his morn shot, shit like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.58,0:49:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}这些都是那些退休的环形使者传出来的\N{\r}Word spread through the ex- looper grapevine
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.12,0:49:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}因为他做的第一件事是封环 封所有人的环\N{\r}because the first thing he did was start closing loops. All of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.38,0:49:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你知道这些数字是什么吗 这些数字\N{\r}You know what this is? This number?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.88,0:49:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}Dale 等一下 慢一点\N{\r}Dale, wait. Slow down.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.51,0:49:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}它会引导我们找到唤雨师\N{\r}it could lead us to the Rainmaker,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.32,0:49:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}Joe 这是医院的记录\N{\r}Joe! It's in the hospital records.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.30,0:49:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}快写下来 0 7 1 5 3\N{\r}Write this down: 0, 7, 1, 5, 3,
