Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.07,0:49:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}这是部分唤雨师的身份信息\N{\r}This is a piece of identifying information on the Rainmaker.
