Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.66,0:50:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我会利用它找到他\N{\r}And I'm gonna use this to find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.00,0:50:06.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}并且杀了他\N{\r}And I'm gonna kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.25,0:50:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我会阻止他杀我的妻子\N{\r}I'm gonna stop him from killing my wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.63,0:50:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}去你的 还有你妻子 这些和我没关系\N{\r}Fuck you. And your wife. None of this concerns me.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.76,0:50:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 这事会发生 - 会发生在你身上\N{\r}- This is gonna happen... - It happened to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.22,0:50:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}但不一定会发生在我身上\N{\r}It doesn't have to happen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.99,0:50:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}在我的怀表里有照片 \N{\r}You got her picture right there in my watch?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.60,0:50:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你拿给我看看 以后如果我看到她 就立马走开\N{\r}Show me the picture. As soon as I see her, I walk away.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.60,0:50:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我会和某个别人结婚 我保证\N{\r}I'll fucking marry someone else. Promise.
