Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.31,0:50:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}就会开始抹去所有的记忆 对吗 她会消失\N{\r}swallow up all the memories, right? She'll be gone.
