Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.10,0:50:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}如果她从来没见过你 她就会很安全\N{\r}If she never meets you, she's safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.24,0:50:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你不明白 我们不会放弃她\N{\r}You don't understand. We don't have to give her up.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.08,0:50:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我不会放弃她的 我要去救她\N{\r}I'm not gonna give her up. I'm gonna save her.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.10,0:51:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}往田里跑 我们可以在田里甩开他们\N{\r}Get to the fields. We can lose them in the fields.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.02,0:51:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}跳上火车 离开这儿\N{\r}Hop a train. Get out of town!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.13,0:51:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}每个人他妈的都在做什么 你们要听我指挥\N{\r}What the hell is everybody doing? You wait for my signal!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.59,0:51:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 在后面 他跑了 - 他往后跑了\N{\r}- Out back! He's running! - He ran out the back!
