Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.41,0:55:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}在过去的一年我杀了并且埋掉了3个流浪汉\N{\r}I have shot and buried three vagrants in the past year!
