Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.73,1:01:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}第一次见到她 第一次见到她\N{\r}The first time I saw her face. The first time I saw your face.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.15,1:01:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}第一次见到她\N{\r}The first time I saw her face.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.15,1:02:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}早安 小猴子 想吃些什么\N{\r}Morning, monkey. Do you want something to eat?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.61,1:02:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}那个男人醒来了\N{\r}The man's up.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.49,1:02:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}他现在是留在这儿了么\N{\r}Is he staying here now?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.95,1:02:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}不\N{\r}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.37,1:02:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}把它扔了\N{\r}Toss it.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.00,1:02:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 我快要清理干净了 - 把它放下\N{\r}- I'm about to finish cleaning it. - Put it down.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.13,1:02:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 你现在感觉如何 - 大概恢复了百分之三十\N{\r}- How are you feeling? - I'd say I'm a 30 percent.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.93,1:02:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}慢慢来 估计这个星期末你将会康复一半\N{\r}You take it slow, by the end of the week you'll be at 50.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.72,1:02:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我收留了你所以你才没死 现在你没事了\N{\r}I took you in so you wouldn't die. You're not.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.27,1:02:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}早上休息一下 然后离开我的农场\N{\r}Take the morning to rest, then get off my farm.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.27,1:03:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 我不能离开 - 为什么\N{\r}- I can't do that. - I'm sorry?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.40,1:03:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我得在这里多留一会儿\N{\r}I need to stay here for a little while.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.61,1:03:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 我可不觉得这样行得通 - 对不起\N{\r}- I'm not cool with that. - Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.53,1:03:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}那么你现在又失去了早上休息的权利了\N{\r}You just lost your take the morning to rest" privileges.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.70,1:03:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 滚出我的农场 - 不\N{\r}- Get off my farm. - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.32,1:03:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}滚出我的农场\N{\r}Get off my farm.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.49,1:03:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你说的这些是吓不倒一个智力迟缓的流浪汉的\N{\r}You couldn't scare a retarded hobo with that. Literally.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.58,1:03:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}这是雷明顿870 一枪就可以射穿你\N{\r}This is a Remington 870. One blast could cut you...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.50,1:03:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}告诉你 就射穿一半而已 你现在举着枪\N{\r}In half. That's telling. You're holding a gun.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.04,1:03:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我说我并不害怕 所以你向我解说了一下这枪\N{\r}I say I'm not afraid, so you describe the gun to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.09,1:03:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}并不是我不是害怕枪\N{\r}It's not the gun I'm not afraid of.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.13,1:03:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你打算怎么做 对着空中开一枪么\N{\r}What are you gonna do, shoot in the air?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.34,1:03:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你不会让我死的 不然也不会救我\N{\r}You wouldn't let me die, you're not gonna kill me.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.34,1:03:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}就意味着我会手软吗\N{\r}So that makes me weak?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.05,1:03:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我并不是你或者你小孩的威胁\N{\r}I'm not a threat to you or your boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.97,1:03:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我呆在你的地盘\N{\r}I need to be on your property.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.72,1:03:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}但不会和你们接触\N{\r}I'd rather there's no contact at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.69,1:03:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我仅仅只是在这里呆一段时间\N{\r}I'm gonna stay in the fields.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.39,1:03:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我只想要你帮我做一件事\N{\r}There's one thing I need,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.77,1:03:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}然后我们之间再无瓜葛\N{\r}then you'll never have to deal with me again.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.40,1:03:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}帮我看下图上标注的地方是不是你的房子 我找对地方没有\N{\r}Verify this is your house so I'm in the right place.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.28,1:03:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 这是什么 - 一张地图\N{\r}- What's this? - It's a map.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.57,1:03:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}这是我的房子 为什么会被标记了\N{\r}That's my house. Why is it marked?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.49,1:03:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}这个你没必要知道 听着\N{\r}Okay, doesn't matter. Look,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.04,1:03:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我会在一个小时之内离开这里\N{\r}I'm gonna be out of the barn in an hour.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.49,1:03:57.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}如果你不介意的话 我想借走这个水壶\N{\r}If you can spare it, I'm gonna take this canteen.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.37,1:03:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}在哪儿能让我把这水壶灌满水\N{\r}Is there somewhere I can fill it?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.18,1:04:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你怎么会有这个号码\N{\r}This number, how did you get this?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.96,1:04:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}难道这个对你有什么意义吗\N{\r}That mean something to you?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.55,1:04:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}怎么了 嘿 嘿 嘿\N{\r}What? Hey! Hey! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.56,1:04:24.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你说得对 我不是杀手\N{\r}You're right. I'm not a killer.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.69,1:04:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}但是我很清楚知道怎么用盐弹打爆你的脸而不会杀死你\N{\r}But I'm fine with how a blast of rock salt to your face won't kill you.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.57,1:04:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}现在 告诉我你是谁\N{\r}Now you're gonna tell me who you are,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.45,1:04:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}还有你他妈的到我的农场来干嘛\N{\r}and what the fuck you're doing on my farm.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.78,1:04:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}好吧\N{\r}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.45,1:04:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}时间旅行至今仍没有被发明出来\N{\r}Time travel hasn't been invented yet,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.33,1:04:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}但是三十年后一定可以\N{\r}but in 30 years, it will have been.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.40,1:04:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}它将会被庞大的黑帮组织利用\N{\r}It's gonna be used by these criminal...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.88,1:04:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你是个环形使者\N{\r}You're a looper?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.10,1:05:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我不能回去 我老板Abe在那座城市里\N{\r}I can't go back to the city because Abe, the boss,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.98,1:05:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}他的人每天24小时\N{\r}his men will be searching
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.58,1:05:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}不间断的找我 直到找到我为止 或者是他\N{\r}for me 24/7 until they find me. Or find him.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.57,1:05:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我剩下就也就这张地图了\N{\r}All I've got is that map.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.36,1:05:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}地图上有三座房子被标注了 你的房子是其中之一\N{\r}He had three houses marked on it, yours is one of them.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.95,1:05:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我知道他马上就会找到这里\N{\r}I know he's coming here.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.49,1:05:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你对环形使者了解多少 你知道我们是做什么的吗\N{\r}You know about loopers? You know what we do?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.95,1:05:22.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}那么他会到这里 来杀我儿子\N{\r}So he's coming here to murder my son
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.79,1:05:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}因为他认为我儿子或许就是这个唤雨师\N{\r}because he thinks he might be this Rainmaker?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.04,1:05:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}一旦他杀了唤雨师后会发生什么\N{\r}Once he kills the Rainmaker, what happens?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.46,1:05:32.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我想 他认为一旦唤雨师死了\N{\r}I think he thinks if he killed the Rainmaker,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.55,1:05:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}他就根本不用被传送回来\N{\r}he never would have been sent back.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.72,1:05:37.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}他会无声无息的消失 就像他的出现一样\N{\r}He'd just vanish. He'd disappear just like he appeared.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.26,1:05:41.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}他就能回去同他的妻子相聚\N{\r}He'd be back with his wife.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.06,1:05:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你放走的这个人是谁\N{\r}Who is he, this guy you let run?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.27,1:05:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}只是某个来自未来的路人甲吗\N{\r}Just some random guy from the future?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.36,1:05:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}他就是某个人而已 你知道这号码有什么特殊意义吗\N{\r}He's just somebody. You know what the numbers mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.24,1:05:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}这是Sid的出生日期\N{\r}This is Cid's birthday
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.41,1:06:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}还有有这是他在医院出生的代号\N{\r}and this is the med code of the hospital he was born in.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.62,1:06:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}当时还有多个孩子和你儿子在那个医院同日出生吗\N{\r}How many kids were born in that hospital that day with your son?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.30,1:06:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 还有两个吗 - 好像是的\N{\r}- Like two? - Sound right.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.21,1:06:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}三个孩子 地图上也正好有3个房子被做了标注\N{\r}Three kids, three houses marked on his map.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.76,1:06:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}这其中有一个就是唤雨师\N{\r}One of them is the Rainmaker.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.43,1:06:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 但是不确定是哪个 - 他打算怎么做\N{\r}- He doesn't know which. - What's he gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.56,1:06:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}天啦\N{\r}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.83,1:08:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}他真的会这么做吗 \N{\r}- Can he really do this?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.55,1:08:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}要知道他觉得只有这么做 才能挽回一切\N{\r}- Think about what doing this would fix what he thinks it would fix.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.34,1:08:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}如果他来了 你会阻止他吗\N{\r}If he comes here, will you stop him?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.06,1:08:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 我是问 我能相信你吗 - 我不关心你是不是信任我\N{\r}- I'm asking, can I trust you? - I don't care if you trust me.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.39,1:08:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}也不关心你儿子的死活\N{\r}I don't care about your son.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.56,1:08:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我失去了我的生活 只有杀了他 才能换回属于我的一切\N{\r}I lost my life. I kill this man, I get it back.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.45,1:08:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}在他杀死其他两个孩子后 就会来这里 与我对峙\N{\r}He'll kill the other two kids and come here last. Put off facing me.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.58,1:08:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}而这些该死的甘蔗丛遮住了我们的视线\N{\r}All this goddamn cane leaves us blind.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.50,1:08:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}他能躲在离这儿只有50码远的地方而不被人发现\N{\r}He can get within 50 yards of this place without a hawk spotting him.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.46,1:08:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我们应该把这片甘蔗丛地给烧平了\N{\r}What makes sense is we burn the fields. Level them.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.00,1:08:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你仓库里头有多少燃气\N{\r}How much gas you got in that barn?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.76,1:09:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你不能把整片甘蔗丛都给烧了\N{\r}No, you can't burn down my cane fields.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.94,1:09:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}可这玩意儿早就死的差不多了\N{\r}This stuff is half dead anyway.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.84,1:09:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}可是这些是来年的种子\N{\r}It's the seed for next year.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.13,1:09:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我不能让你这么干的 绝对不行\N{\r}It's not gonna happen, you fucking nut.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.06,1:09:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}听着 这里的任何地方都可以为你所用\N{\r}Listen, use what you need and set up anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.61,1:09:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}但是有一点 我不想让你和Cid讲话\N{\r}But one thing: I don't want you talking to Cid.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.36,1:09:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我看着我儿子 你看着甘蔗丛\N{\r}I watch my son, you watch the cane.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.45,1:09:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 就这么说定了 - 我没意见\N{\r}- That's the deal. - Good by me.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.20,1:09:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}好吧\N{\r}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.78,1:09:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 天啊 - 好了 别动\N{\r}- Jesus. - All right, hold still.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.95,1:09:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}在农场里伤口很容易被感染的\N{\r}It's easy for things to get infected on a farm.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.33,1:09:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}得帮你把它弄干净\N{\r}Start falling off.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.42,1:09:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}胆小鬼\N{\r}Pussy.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.88,1:09:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我守在外边 你呆在屋里\N{\r}I'm out here and you're in the house.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.85,1:09:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我们需要想个联系方式\N{\r}We need a way to communicate.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.55,1:09:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}在仓库里头有个餐车铃\N{\r}There's a dinner bell in the barn.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.43,1:09:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}如果有人来了 你就摇铃铛\N{\r}You can ring that if someone's coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.68,1:09:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}餐车铃 我们需要的是蜂音机 扩音器之类的\N{\r}Dinner bell. We need buzzers or walkies or something.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.64,1:09:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我不知道我们有没有 我去找找看\N{\r}I don't know what we've got, but I'll look.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.31,1:09:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}Cid\N{\r}Cid!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.27,1:10:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 你不是在做数学题吗 - 我想帮这个男人\N{\r}- How's the math coming? - I want to help the man.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.07,1:10:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 你怎么帮他呢 - 我可以用我的玩具帮他\N{\r}- Help him with what? - I could help him with my toys.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.03,1:10:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}不行 听我说\N{\r}No. Let me talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.78,1:10:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我需要你离那个男人远点 知道吗\N{\r}I need you to stay away from that man. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.49,1:10:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}让他做他该做的事 而你只需要跟着我\N{\r}Let him do his thing, but stick with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.79,1:10:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 知道了吗 - 难道他不是好人么\N{\r}- Okay? - Is he not good?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.58,1:10:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}这个 让我们看看再说吧 好吗 但是我要你必须跟着我\N{\r}Well, we're gonna see what he is. All right? But I need you to stick with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.67,1:10:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}好孩子\N{\r}Good boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.25,1:10:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}嘘\N{\r}Shh.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.60,1:11:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}把那个小螺丝刀给我\N{\r}Hand me that Phillips.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.94,1:11:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 如果你听到她过来了告诉我 - 你在做什么\N{\r}- Tell me if you hear her coming. - What are we doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.40,1:11:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}通讯工具\N{\r}Commundication.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.07,1:11:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}但是我需要把这个弄的更强大些\N{\r}But I need to make it stronger.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.86,1:11:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 我们要怎么做 - 更大的电池\N{\r}- How do we do that? - Bigger battery.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.66,1:11:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}聪明\N{\r}Smart.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.83,1:11:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你杀过人么\N{\r}Do you kill people?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.67,1:11:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}额 这么说吧 我以杀人为生\N{\r}Uh... Let's say I kill people.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.46,1:11:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}用你的枪吗\N{\r}With your gun?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.05,1:11:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}嗯哼\N{\r}Uh- huh.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.51,1:11:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 你想要一把跟我一样的枪吗 - 是的\N{\r}- You want a gun like mine? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.76,1:11:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}那你会拿它做什么 撑杆跳吗 它比你大多了\N{\r}What are you gonna do with it, pole vaulting? It's bigger than you.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.31,1:12:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}防患于未然\N{\r}Stop bad things from happening.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.36,1:12:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我擦\N{\r}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.58,1:12:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}那么你和你妈妈多久离开这个农场一次\N{\r}So how long you and your mom been out here on the farm?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.00,1:12:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}她不是\N{\r}She's not.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.42,1:12:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}她不是什么\N{\r}She's not what?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.09,1:12:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}Sara不知道 但是我记得我真正的妈妈\N{\r}Sara doesn't know, but I remember my real mom.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.76,1:12:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}当我还是个婴儿的时候 我无法阻止\N{\r}When I was a baby, I couldn't stop it.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.14,1:12:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}无法阻止什么\N{\r}Couldn't stop what?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.19,1:12:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}阻止她被人杀死\N{\r}I couldn't stop her from getting killed.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.61,1:12:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我看见了 但是我阻止不了\N{\r}I saw it, but I couldn't stop it.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.61,1:12:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我当时还不够强壮\N{\r}I wasn't strong enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.83,1:12:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你应该 额\N{\r}You should, uh...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.91,1:13:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你应该跟你妈妈谈谈\N{\r}You should talk to your mom about this.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.24,1:13:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}她不是我的妈妈 她是个骗子\N{\r}She's not my mom. She's a liar.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.76,1:13:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}发现他从下水道西头的出口处走了出来 他在逃跑\N{\r}Spotted him coming out of a sewer tunnel on the west end. He's on the run.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.78,1:13:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}他现在正朝着西头的塔街跑去\N{\r}Think he's heading to the west on Talbott Street,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.99,1:13:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}可能去了Alley妓院 我们在那里有眼线\N{\r}possibly to Whore's Alley. We have a visual.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.87,1:13:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}如果你不用锄头或者其他的东西是砍不断的\N{\r}You can't take that thing out with a plow or something?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.17,1:13:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}嗯哼\N{\r}Uh- huh.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.96,1:13:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}听着 我发现了一个 额\N{\r}Listen, I found a, uh...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.76,1:13:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}在仓库里头我找到了一些零件 我做了一个东西\N{\r}In the barn, I found some parts and I made a thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.55,1:13:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}这里\N{\r}Here.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.52,1:14:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}如果你看到了什么 你就按下这个东西\N{\r}So if you see something, just push that.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.81,1:14:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}什么时候\N{\r}When?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.40,1:14:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}昨晚 他把我吵醒了 不要跟他说我告诉你了 他还不\N{\r}Last night he woke me up. Don't tell him I told you. He didn't...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.95,1:14:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你说你是她的妈妈\N{\r}You said you were his morn.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.49,1:14:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}是的\N{\r}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.62,1:14:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}他说你不是\N{\r}He told me you're not.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.87,1:14:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}他这样说的么\N{\r}He said that?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.34,1:14:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}是的\N{\r}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.59,1:14:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 如果他不是你的儿子 他是谁呢 - 他是我的儿子\N{\r}- If he's not your son, who is he? - He's my son.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.14,1:14:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我在22岁的时候我有了Cid\N{\r}I had Cid when I was 22.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.97,1:14:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}但是我不想放弃我在城里的生活\N{\r}But I didn't want to give up my life in the city.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.77,1:14:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}所以我把他丢在了这个农场给我的姐姐养\N{\r}So I dropped him here on the farm with my sister,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.73,1:14:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}她发现我是以什么为生后 就把他带走了\N{\r}and she saw how I was living, so she took him.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.65,1:14:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我的姐姐 一直替我抚养他\N{\r}And my sister, she raised him.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.15,1:15:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}她爱他 他叫她"妈妈"\N{\r}She loved him. He called her Morn.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.50,1:15:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}那她又是怎么被杀害的\N{\r}How did she get killed?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.38,1:15:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我的上帝\N{\r}Jesus Christ.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.67,1:15:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}他记得很清楚 你必须跟他谈谈这件事\N{\r}He remembers it. You've gotta talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.00,1:15:16.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我告诉过你了 我告诉过你远离我的儿子\N{\r}I told you one thing. I told you to stay away from my son.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.63,1:15:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 他问我要了枪 - 请你离远点\N{\r}- He asked about my gun. - Stay out of it!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.34,1:15:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你他妈离我儿子远一点\N{\r}And stay the fuck away from my son!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.43,1:15:28.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}56去哪里呢\N{\r}Where does 56 go?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.60,1:15:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}噢 很好 你蛮聪明\N{\r}Oh, good. You're smart.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.61,1:15:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}二十一\N{\r}Twenty- one?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.82,1:15:35.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你不睡觉的话能撑多久\N{\r}How long can you not sleep?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.15,1:15:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我不知道 大概一会儿吧 问得不错啊\N{\r}I don't know. Probably a while. It's a good question.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.11,1:15:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}去哪里呢 快说啊\N{\r}Where does it go? Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.37,1:15:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}很好 \N{\r}Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.00,1:15:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}三十二\N{\r}Thirty- two?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.58,1:15:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 你应该帮助Joe盯着 - Joe\N{\r}- You should help Joe watch. - Joe?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.75,1:15:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}因为他不能一直不睡觉\N{\r}Because he can't stay awake all the time.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.17,1:15:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 这不是我们事情 知道么 - 他在保护我们的安全\N{\r}- Ain't our business. Ok? - He's keeping us safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.96,1:15:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}让我们继续玩游戏 好么\N{\r}Let's do this now, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.80,1:16:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你有一个三十二 我知道你肯定知道这个应该放在哪儿\N{\r}You have 32 there. I know you know this one.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.72,1:16:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}不 八乘以三是多少 三十二\N{\r}No. Eight times three is what? Thirty- two.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.22,1:16:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}八乘以三是多少\N{\r}Eight times three is what?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.44,1:16:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}三十二 \N{\r}Thirty- two.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.15,1:16:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 我是让你用三个八相加 - 八 十六\N{\r}- I want you to count three eights. - Eight, sixteen...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.99,1:16:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}三十二\N{\r}thirty- two.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.20,1:16:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 你是在告诉我你想关禁闭吗 - 不是\N{\r}- You telling me you want alone time? - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.58,1:16:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}那你为什么不把这个放到正确的位置\N{\r}Then why don't you put that where it belongs?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.29,1:16:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 禁闭 - 他在保护我们\N{\r}- Alone time. - He's protecting us
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.34,1:16:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}因为你做不到\N{\r}because you can't do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.30,1:16:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 我告诉过你 离他远点 不是吗 - 我可从没做过任何事\N{\r}- I told you to stay away from him, didn't I? - I never did anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.01,1:16:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 你是觉得我很蠢么 - 那有怎样\N{\r}- Do you think I'm stupid? - So.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.93,1:16:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 我告诉过Joe 让他离开 - 那有怎样\N{\r}- I told Joe to leave... - So!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.68,1:16:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 你应该按照我说的做 - 你不能够要求我怎么做\N{\r}- You do what I tell you! - You can't tell me what to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.68,1:16:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你又不是我妈妈\N{\r}You're not my mom!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.27,1:16:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你不是我的妈妈 你是个骗子\N{\r}You're not my mom! You're a liar!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.44,1:16:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}如果你不停止撒谎的话 你会被杀掉的\N{\r}You're gonna get killed because you won't stop lying!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.36,1:16:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- Cid 冷静 - 骗子 你一直在对我说谎\N{\r}- Cid, calm down... - Liar, you're lying to me,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.90,1:17:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 你一直在对我说谎 我讨厌你 - Cid\N{\r}- You're lying to me! I hate you! - Cid...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.19,1:17:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 我讨厌你 骗子 你在说谎 - 冷静 冷静\N{\r}- I hate you! Liar! You're lying! - Calm down. Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.63,1:17:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}骗子\N{\r}Liar!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.88,1:17:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}骗子\N{\r}Liar!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.64,1:17:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你不是我的妈妈 你个大骗子\N{\r}You're not my mom! You're a liar!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.81,1:17:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你不是我的妈妈\N{\r}You're not my mom!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.69,1:17:36.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我讨厌你\N{\r}I hate you!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.06,1:17:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}骗子\N{\r}Liar!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.73,1:17:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}骗子 骗子\N{\r}Liar! Liar!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.35,1:18:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}对不起\N{\r}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.98,1:18:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}没事了 宝贝\N{\r}It's okay, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.99,1:19:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}卧了个槽\N{\r}Holy shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.00,1:20:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}傍晚好 女士\N{\r}Evening, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.50,1:20:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}好 有什么需要我帮忙的吗\N{\r}Evening. How can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.51,1:20:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}啊哈 你可以先从接受我的道歉开始\N{\r}Ahem. You can start by accepting my apologies re the hour.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.39,1:20:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 希望我没有打扰到你们的晚餐 - 没关系的\N{\r}Hope I didn't catch you at supper. That's fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.10,1:20:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}在这烈日底下 我已经看过了周边所有的空农场了\N{\r}I've been walking between empty farms all day.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.81,1:20:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}想把这个从名单里划掉\N{\r}Thought I'd just tick this one off the list.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.31,1:20:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 就不用明天再回来了 - 为了什么\N{\r}- Not have to come back tomorrow. - What's this about?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.90,1:20:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你是一个人住在这儿吗 女士\N{\r}You alone here, ma'am?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.98,1:20:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我的丈夫随时都可能回来\N{\r}My husband should be back any time.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.03,1:20:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}很高兴可以听到这些 \N{\r}Happy to hear it.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.03,1:20:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}能打扰下借口水喝吗\N{\r}Could I trouble you for some water?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.70,1:20:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我替你去拿吧 我会给你倒一杯的\N{\r}I'll get you some. You can take the glass with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.91,1:20:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}事实上 女士\N{\r}Actually, ma'am,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.87,1:20:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我今天的工作 就是要查完这张表上的所有地方\N{\r}my business today, this ticking off the list business,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.38,1:20:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我必须要进去 如果你不介意的话\N{\r}is gonna require me coming in, if that's all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.63,1:20:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 能告诉我究竟是什么事吗 - 当然会了\N{\r}Will you tell me what this is about? I will, yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.76,1:20:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我能进去吗\N{\r}Can I come in?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.85,1:21:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}女士\N{\r}Ma'am?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.86,1:21:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我是个警官 正在追捕逃犯\N{\r}I'm a deputized police officer, looking for an escaped criminal.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.32,1:21:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}这两天你有见到什么可疑人物吗 比如流浪汉\N{\r}Anyone through here in the past two days, vagrants?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.54,1:21:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}路过的流浪汉倒是很多 但没人接近这房子 \N{\r}Vagrants are always passing, nobody near the house.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.37,1:21:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}那他呢\N{\r}That man there?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.50,1:21:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 他很年轻 - 没见过\N{\r}He's young. No.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.71,1:21:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我们也在找他的父亲\N{\r}We're looking for his father too.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.64,1:21:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}身材和长相都差不多 接近60岁\N{\r}Similar looking build, late 50s,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.67,1:21:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}他们不一定是在一起\N{\r}may or may not be traveling together.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.18,1:21:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你认识他们吗\N{\r}Do you recognize them?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.26,1:21:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 不 - 留着吧\N{\r}- No. - Keep them.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.81,1:21:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你的孩子们都和丈夫在一起\N{\r}Your kids with your husband?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.65,1:21:47.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}是的 就一个孩子\N{\r}Yeah, just one.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.27,1:21:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 多少岁 - 十岁\N{\r}- How old? - Ten.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.86,1:21:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}十岁\N{\r}Ten...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.80,1:22:13.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我带你去谷仓和屋子里看看吧\N{\r}I'm gonna show you the barn and house.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.92,1:22:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}然后你就可以走了\N{\r}And then you can be on your way.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.01,1:22:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我已经自作主张看过你的谷仓了 抱歉\N{\r}I took the liberty with your barn. Apologies.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.93,1:22:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}那就看看房子吧\N{\r}So the house.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.87,1:22:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 你说你的孩子十岁 - 是的\N{\r}- Ten, you said? Your boy? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.54,1:22:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}丈夫呢 \N{\r}And your husband?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.33,1:22:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我得连接到本部核对一下\N{\r}I've just gotta check in with the home office.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.33,1:22:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你说孩子是和父亲一起在市里 那他什么时候回来\N{\r}The boy's in the city with his father. When they getting back?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.75,1:22:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我也说不准\N{\r}Couldn't tell you.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.22,1:22:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}啊\N{\r}Ah.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.64,1:23:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}这该死的玩意\N{\r}This goddamn thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.76,1:23:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我收到的信号从没有这么差过\N{\r}I can never get a signal this far out of town.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.85,1:23:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}啊 真够烂的\N{\r}Ah. Piece of shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.65,1:23:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}好了 我们继续\N{\r}Okay. Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.86,1:23:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}这是个危险人物\N{\r}Is this man dangerous?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.62,1:23:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}他靠杀人而活 是个冷血杀手\N{\r}He shoots men down for a living. He's a stone- cold killer.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.66,1:23:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}上级用了半个城市的警力来抓捕他\N{\r}My boss has half the city looking for him.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.96,1:23:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}当然我也包括其中 所以\N{\r}Half the city and me, so...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.58,1:23:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}如果你能找到他 赏金可是不少\N{\r}And if you find him, there's a hell of a price.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.21,1:23:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}整整一大捆 好好考虑下吧\N{\r}Chunk of money like that, you should think on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.92,1:23:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 我会的 - 那就好 带我去楼上看看\N{\r}- I will. - Alright. Show me upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.80,1:23:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}这个房子里常有穿堂风\N{\r}There's drafts in the house.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.99,1:24:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}这个通道是我爷爷在流浪汉到处犯事儿的时候挖的\N{\r}My granddad built this tunnel when the vagrant raids got bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.04,1:24:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 奶奶说他疯了 - 真是多谢你爷爷了\N{\r}- Nana said he was nuts. - Thank you, Granddad.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.38,1:24:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 他不是警察吧 - 不是 不过有趣的是 我认识他\N{\r}- That wasn't the man. - No. It's funny. I know that guy, though.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.92,1:24:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}他叫Jessie 我挺喜欢他 他是个好人\N{\r}His name is Jesse. I like him. He's good.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.93,1:24:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}只要找不到我 他就会走\N{\r}He's gonna go away once he doesn't find me.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.64,1:24:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}他不会伤害你妈妈的\N{\r}He won't hurt your mom.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.02,1:24:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- Sara - 你的妈妈呢\N{\r}Sara. Where's your mom?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.65,1:24:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我妈妈啊 \N{\r}Where's my mom?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.32,1:24:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我比你还小的时候 她 她就抛弃我了\N{\r}She, uh, gave me up. I was younger than you.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.16,1:24:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我们都是流浪汉 而她孤身一人\N{\r}We were vagrants, and she was alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.24,1:24:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我一直想着她是有多么愚蠢才染上了毒品\N{\r}I thought she was stupid for getting on the drugs she was on,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.71,1:24:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}不过现在我明白了 她不过是太寂寞了\N{\r}but now I see she was just so alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.13,1:24:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}她一无所有\N{\r}It's what she had.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.09,1:25:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}她把我卖给了一个儿童行乞组织\N{\r}She sold me to a panhandle gang.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.84,1:25:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我逃走了 跳上了一列火车\N{\r}I got away and I ran and ended up on this train.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:05.26,1:25:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我还记得我坐在那个空荡荡的车厢\N{\r}I remember I was sitting there in an empty car.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.47,1:25:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我总是一次次地\N{\r}And I saw myself over and over again,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:10.64,1:25:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}幻想自己杀死那些买下我的人\N{\r}killing those men that bought me,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.95,1:25:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}让我妈妈染上毒品的人\N{\r}that got my mom on what she was on.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.56,1:25:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我只想找到他们 并把他们撕成碎片 救出我妈妈\N{\r}Just finding them and tearing them apart. Saving my mom.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.69,1:25:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}但你没有\N{\r}But you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.24,1:25:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}没有 一个男人找到我 给了我一把枪\N{\r}No, a man in the city found me, put a gun in my hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.16,1:25:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}还给了一些本来就属于我的东西\N{\r}Gave me something that was mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.29,1:25:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}那个男人在对付别人之前\N{\r}That's just men trying to figure out
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.11,1:25:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}一定会搞清楚为了保护自己的东西那人会做什么\N{\r}what they would do to keep what's theirs, what they've got.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.46,1:25:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}他是那里唯一和蔼的人\N{\r}That's the only kind of man there is.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.04,1:25:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我不会让Sara被杀掉的\N{\r}I'm not gonna let Sara get killed.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.43,1:25:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我想我们安全了\N{\r}I think we're clear.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.70,1:26:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}Sara\N{\r}Sara!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.79,1:26:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}宝贝\N{\r}Baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.22,1:26:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}都是些卖身女孩 对吗\N{\r}All working girls, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.72,1:26:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}这整个街区 还有那边几个街区也是\N{\r}This whole block and a couple of blocks over.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.15,1:26:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你好 Joe\N{\r}Hello, Joe.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.48,1:26:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}如果你要看看那边的 我可以安排\N{\r}If you want to check those, too, I can arrange.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.70,1:26:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我是个给陌生人牵线的中间人\N{\r}I'm an arranger, stranger.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.99,1:26:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}但如果你没找到你想要的 我就不要酬金\N{\r}If you don't see what you want to see, no refunds.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.22,1:27:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}怎么了\N{\r}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.77,1:28:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}发生了什么\N{\r}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:46.69,1:28:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}这可真棒\N{\r}That's pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:51.57,1:28:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}在城里 年轻小伙\N{\r}In the city, young guys would
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.32,1:28:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}总他妈的喜欢用悬浮硬币的方式找我搭讪\N{\r}hit on me by floating fucking quarters.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.79,1:29:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我不会告诉他们我也是TK\N{\r}And I wouldn't tell them I was TK,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.21,1:29:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}不过我会让他们的硬币飞不起来\N{\r}but I would keep their quarters down.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:05.25,1:29:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}有个家伙眼里都暴起了血丝 都没让硬币飘起来\N{\r}This one guy just busted a blood vessel in his eye trying to get it up.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:23.90,1:29:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}他就是你\N{\r}He's you.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:26.02,1:29:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}未来的你\N{\r}Your loop.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.19,1:29:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你对我说谎了\N{\r}You lied to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.74,1:29:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}但你说你要杀了那家伙的时候\N{\r}But I know you're not lying
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.29,1:29:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我知道你没有说谎\N{\r}when you say you're gonna kill this guy,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.74,1:29:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}尽管那家伙就是你自己\N{\r}your own self.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.99,1:29:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你在那个枪手的面前保护了Cid\N{\r}You protected Cid from that gat man.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.21,1:29:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}额\N{\r}Uh...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.63,1:29:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 是的 - 他救了你一命 对吗\N{\r}- Yeah. - He saved your ass, didn't he?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.71,1:29:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}他救了我 是的\N{\r}He saved my ass. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.92,1:29:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}他是\N{\r}He's a...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.59,1:29:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}他是个好孩子\N{\r}He's a good kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.43,1:29:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}是啊 当然\N{\r}Yeah, he is.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.10,1:30:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}在我姐姐死后 我回到那里\N{\r}You know, when I came back, after my sister died,
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.27,1:30:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}那是两年来我第一次\N{\r}I remember seeing him
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.86,1:30:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}见到他 小小的一团坐在门廊那儿\N{\r}for the first time in two years, just sitting on the porch.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:14.91,1:30:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我开着车大哭 我接到电话的时候\N{\r}I drove up crying. I'd been at this
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.62,1:30:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}正在城里参加一个通宵派对\N{\r}party all night in the city when I got the call...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:26.42,1:30:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}因此我穿着一件可笑的派对装\N{\r}so I was wearing this ridiculous party dress.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.38,1:30:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我的一切都那么可笑\N{\r}All my ridiculous shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.05,1:30:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}而我不知道\N{\r}And I don't know if he...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.51,1:30:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}他究竟还记不记得我\N{\r}even remembered me,
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.52,1:30:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}但他就那么看着我\N{\r}but he looked at me...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:54.11,1:30:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我抛弃了他\N{\r}I abandoned him.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:59.95,1:31:02.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我抛弃了我的孩子\N{\r}I abandoned my baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:07.33,1:31:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我在城里见过太多的人\N{\r}And I've seen so many men in the city,
Dialogue: 0,1:31:11.63,1:31:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}每当我看着他们的眼睛 里面只有迷茫\N{\r}who I look in their eyes and they're just lost.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:17.76,1:31:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}因此无论我给他的爱会不会有回报\N{\r}So whether he loves me back or not,
Dialogue: 0,1:31:22.22,1:31:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}只要我还在抚养他\N{\r}as long as I'm there to raise him,
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.85,1:31:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}就会好好照顾他\N{\r}he's gonna be taken care of.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:30.90,1:31:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}他会安安全全的\N{\r}He's gonna be safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.32,1:31:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}永远不会迷失\N{\r}He's never gonna get lost.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.39,1:32:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你好 Joe\N{\r}Hello, Joe.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:03.26,1:32:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}Jessie\N{\r}Jesse.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.06,1:32:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我把枪放下了 让她走\N{\r}Put this down and let her go.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:10.73,1:32:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}Sara Jessie 是我所知道的这里最好的枪手\N{\r}Sara, Jesse here is the best shot with a gat that I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:15.07,1:32:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}所以他放开你后 你就好好坐在沙发上\N{\r}When he lets you go, just sit on the couch.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.47,1:32:18.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}别有其它心思\N{\r}Don't do anything stupid.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:24.66,1:32:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}他就要来了 Jess 另一个"我"正在来这里的路上\N{\r}He's coming here, Jess. My loop is coming here.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:27.75,1:32:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 我必须得抓你回去了 - 我有948块纯银条\N{\r}I gotta take you in. I got 948 bars of pure silver.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:31.79,1:32:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我会封死自己的环 然后和Abe好好谈谈\N{\r}I close my loop, I get right with Abe.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:33.96,1:32:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}无论他给我什么回报 我都与你平分\N{\r}Whatever he gives back, I'll split it with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:36.59,1:32:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}那就是你的计划\N{\r}Was that your plan?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:39.26,1:32:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}好吧 全给你\N{\r}Okay, take all of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.55,1:32:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你吃错药了吗 没有人会和你好好谈的\N{\r}Are you delusional? You ain't getting right.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:43.39,1:32:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}只要Abe还剩下哪怕一个枪手\N{\r}Long as Abe's got one gat man standing
Dialogue: 0,1:32:45.10,1:32:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}到死他都会一直追杀你的\N{\r}he's gonna hunt you till his dying day.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:48.60,1:32:49.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我们得走了 \N{\r}We're gonna go now.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.49,1:32:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我去开我的车 而你就\N{\r}Gonna get in my truck and you're just gonna...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:07.12,1:33:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}对不起\N{\r}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:11.47,1:34:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}唤雨师\N{\r}The Rainmaker...
Dialogue: 0,1:34:36.29,1:34:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}Cid\N{\r}Cid!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:38.08,1:34:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}Cid\N{\r}Cid!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:40.63,1:34:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}噢 我的天啊\N{\r}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:45.26,1:34:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}Cid\N{\r}Cid!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:49.22,1:34:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}Cid\N{\r}Cid?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:51.51,1:34:55.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}是他 他是怎么回事 某种TK怪物\N{\r}It's him. What is he, some TK freak?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:55.89,1:34:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你早就知道\N{\r}You knew.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:59.98,1:35:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 你拿着枪想做什么 - 你姐姐是怎么死的\N{\r}- What are you doing? - How did your sister die?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:02.53,1:35:06.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 你拿着枪要干什么 - 就像刚才发生的那样吗\N{\r}- What are you doing with those guns? Is that what happened to her?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:06.20,1:35:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 不是 - 他是不是就是那样把她杀死了\N{\r}- No! - He kill her like that?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:07.91,1:35:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}不 他当时正爬一个书架 然后书架倒了下来压住了他\N{\r}No. He was climbing a bookshelf and it fell back on him.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.45,1:35:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}他太过害怕了 就不小心爆发了出来\N{\r}He can get scared. It exploded.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:14.08,1:35:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 天啊 要命的 - 他会学会怎么控制自己的\N{\r}Jesus frigging... He'll learn to control it.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:16.62,1:35:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 想象他会做些什么 - 但是他也可能用它来做好事的\N{\r}Imagine what he's gonna do! If he did good with it, though.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:20.67,1:35:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}如果他由我抚养长大\N{\r}If he grew up with me raising him.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:23.71,1:35:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}如果他成为一个好人\N{\r}If he grew up good...
Dialogue: 0,1:35:27.38,1:35:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}他不会\N{\r}He doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:29.14,1:35:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你离他远一点 Joe\N{\r}You stay away from him, Joe!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:36.18,1:35:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}Cid 离Joe远一点 宝贝\N{\r}Cid! Stay away from Joe, baby!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:40.81,1:35:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}跟着我 宝贝\N{\r}Follow me, baby!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.79,1:36:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}到我这儿来 没事的\N{\r}Come to me. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:48.72,1:36:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}没事的 宝贝\N{\r}It's okay, baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:53.85,1:36:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}目前有两件事情发生\N{\r}Right now two things have happened.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:55.85,1:36:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}另一个"我"知道了Cid就是他要找的孩子\N{\r}My loop knows Cid's the kid he's looking for.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:58.35,1:37:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我的同伴也知道我在这儿\N{\r}And my gang knows I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:00.27,1:37:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}也就是说十五分钟内\N{\r}That means in 15 minutes,
Dialogue: 0,1:37:01.60,1:37:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}一方或者双方都会从那条公路上赶来\N{\r}one or both of them is coming down that highway.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:04.73,1:37:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}准备好车 带上所有必须的东西然后立刻离开\N{\r}Pack up the truck. Take everything you can and go.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:07.61,1:37:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}开车向北 离开这城市\N{\r}Drive north away from the city.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:10.78,1:37:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}谢谢你\N{\r}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:25.21,1:37:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}全部人都向这里出发 我们所有的人\N{\r}Got everyone here, all our men.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:27.38,1:37:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}全副武装 立刻行动\N{\r}Arm them up. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:38.22,1:37:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我抓到他了 Abe 我抓到他了\N{\r}I got him, Abe. I got him.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:41.10,1:37:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我操\N{\r}Well, shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:46.06,1:37:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}就是这样 狗娘养的\N{\r}That's right, motherfuckers.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:48.36,1:37:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}喔 我抓到他了\N{\r}Whoa. I got him.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:50.69,1:37:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我知道他去了某个妓女那里\N{\r}Knew he was sweet on this one whore.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:52.82,1:37:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 于是我彻查了她住的楼 - 他们也找到了Joe\N{\r}I checked her building... They found Joe
Dialogue: 0,1:37:55.28,1:37:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}在东边的一个农场里 这就是为什么所有的枪手都来了\N{\r}in a farm on the east side. That's why all the gat men are here.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:59.08,1:38:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}整个队伍全副武装要去扫平那里\N{\r}The whole crew is arming up to make a sweep.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:02.21,1:38:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}Joe\N{\r}Joe?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:03.71,1:38:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}去他妈的Joe 省省你们的子弹吧 我已经抓到了他的"环"了\N{\r}Fuck Joe. Save your bullets! I've got the loop!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:07.38,1:38:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}他妈的搞什么名堂 我带他来是要见Abe\N{\r}Not such a fuck- up now, huh? I'm bringing him up to see Abe.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:21.39,1:38:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}抓住这混蛋\N{\r}Get this asshole!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:25.35,1:38:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}狗娘养的\N{\r}Motherfuckers!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:38.80,1:39:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}卧槽\N{\r}Holy shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:47.69,1:39:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}Joe\N{\r}Joe!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:51.23,1:39:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}当年还是我教的那孩子用枪 哈\N{\r}Guess I put the gun in that kid's hand, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:57.20,1:40:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我想这就是现世报了\N{\r}I guess everything comes back around.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:01.70,1:40:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}就像你那该死的领带一样\N{\r}Like your goddamn ties.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:28.37,1:41:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}坐上这辆车 带着你的钱去过自己的生活吧\N{\r}Take this truck. And take your gold and go live your life.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:31.96,1:41:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}没人会再追杀你 我已经帮你解决了\N{\r}Nobody's coming after you. I fixed it.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:35.84,1:41:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你要杀掉那个男孩 你是打算这样解决问题吗\N{\r}You go kill the boy. That how you fix it?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:38.25,1:41:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你说的太他妈对了 我就要杀掉那小子\N{\r}You're goddamn right I'm gonna kill that boy!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:41.01,1:41:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 你刚刚获得了新生活 - 我的生活\N{\r}You just got your life back. My life?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:44.22,1:41:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}是你的生活 要我成为你\N{\r}Your life. Becoming you.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:47.18,1:41:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}去你妈的 你他妈的疯了吗\N{\r}Goddamn it! You've lost your fucking mind!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:50.18,1:41:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}你若让那孩子活下去 他会夺走你拥有的一切\N{\r}You let this boy live, he's gonna take everything you've got.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:54.19,1:41:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}还有我拥有的一切\N{\r}And everything I got!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:57.06,1:42:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}- 你也看到了他变成什么模样 - 我并没有看到\N{\r}See what he becomes. I haven't seen that yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:00.28,1:42:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}我操\N{\r}Goddamn it!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:53.54,1:42:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn宋体\fs23\shad2\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}擦\N{\r}Shit.
